sequenceDiagram
    participant device as Appareil autorise
    participant lan as Appareil du LAN de confiance
    participant tailnet as Reseau prive Tailscale
    participant pi as Raspberry Pi - Tailscale Serve
    participant panel as Home Panel
    participant app as Home App
    participant core as Home Core
    participant ha as Home Assistant local

    device->>tailnet: Connexion chiffree avec identite Tailscale
    tailnet->>pi: Autorise seulement selon la politique tailnet
    pi->>panel: Proxy HTTPS vers 127.0.0.1:13000

    opt Ouverture LAN explicitement configuree
        lan->>panel: HTTP vers Raspberry Pi:13000
    end
    pi->>app: Proxy HTTPS vers 127.0.0.1:13444
    panel->>core: /v1 sur le reseau Docker prive home-ai
    app->>core: /v1 sur le reseau Docker prive home-ai
    core->>core: Authentification et autorisation Home Core
    core->>ha: Commande autorisee sur le reseau local
    ha-->>core: Etat confirme
    core-->>panel: Resultat explicite
    panel-->>device: Home Panel et retour d'etat
    app-->>device: Home App et retour d'etat

    Note over device,pi: Aucun port entrant routeur, Home Assistant ou Home Core public
